StyleBody\">…</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Apple Symbols&quot;\">☀︎</span><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-family:Menlo-Regular\">☼</span><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Apple Symbols&quot;\">☀︎</span><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\">おもてなし会②</span><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-family:Menlo-Regular\">☼</span><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Apple Symbols&quot;\">☀︎</span><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-family:Menlo-Regular\">☼</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;min-height:24.5px\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal\"><span class=\"s1\">私は『キュン』と『青春の馬』のフロントメンバーに選んでいただきました。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;min-height:24.5px\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:17px;line-height:normal;min-height:24.5px\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:UICTFontTextStyleBody\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin:0px;font